@startuml
title Alarm Clock State Machine

[*] --> Off

Off --> ActiveAlarm : Set alarm time
ActiveAlarm --> RingingAlarm : Match current time with set alarm time
RingingAlarm --> StoppedAlarm : Turn off alarm / Stop ringing
StoppedAlarm --> ActiveAlarm : Next scheduled alarm time

state ActiveAlarm {
    [*] --> AlarmOn : Activate alarm
}

state RingingAlarm {
    [*] --> Ringing : Current time matches set alarm time
}
@enduml
